# .antigravityrules
# Cakra Workflow Service — AI Agent Slash Commands
# Semua command di file ini otomatis tersedia sebagai slash command di Antigravity IDE.
# Letakkan file ini di ROOT project.
#
# QUICK REFERENCE:
# /planning        → Diskusi awal fitur baru (AI Pintar)
# /create-issue    → Tuangkan hasil diskusi ke ISSUES.md (AI Pintar)
# /impl-plan       → Buat implementation plan (AI Pintar)
# /adr             → Catat keputusan arsitektur ke DECISIONS.md (AI Pintar)
# /preflight       → Pre-flight check sebelum coding (AI Murah)
# /implement       → Implementasi task (AI Murah)
# /review          → Code review (AI Pintar)
# /fix             → Fix temuan review (AI Murah)
# /rereview        → Re-review setelah fix (AI Pintar)
# /unit-test       → Generate unit tests (AI Murah)
# /coverage        → Verifikasi test coverage (AI Murah)
# /integration-test→ Integration test (AI Murah)
# /security-scan   → Security scan (AI Murah)
# /wrap-session    → Update WORKING_MEMORY di akhir sesi (AI Murah)

